        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this fantastic three-bedroom end of terrace family home with a large side & sunny west facing rear garden to the market ideally positioned on a peaceful cul de sac in St Aongus Green, Dublin 24. The property is conveniently located just moments from Tallaght Village where you will find yourself within easy reach of schools, shops, restaurants and a whole host of other local amenities the Tallaght area has to offer. The M50 Motorway is found merely minutes by car and the transport links in the area are second to none with bus stops close by and the LUAS at the Square Shopping Centre within easy reach.\r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious interior living accommodation of c. 98 sqm comprises of entrance porch, hallway with guest bathroom, large living room with fireplace, fully fitted kitchen and separate dining/second living area to the rear. Upstairs you have three generous bedrooms with built in wardrobes and a fully tiled main family bathroom. To the rear of the property you have a fully enclosed private low maintenance garden which boasts a block-built unit to the rear which is great for additional storage, it is further benefitted by a highly sought after west facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings. The front boasts off street parking on a peaceful cul de sac whilst there is plenty of further development to the side. \r\n\r\nNumber 14 St Aongus Green is presented in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners but could use some modernisation throughout. Due to its size and location it has the potential to be the perfect family home with additional features such as fully fitted kitchen, generous living space, ample amount of storage and gas-fired central heating to name but a few. \r\n\r\nThis one is sure to be a hit with a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get on the property ladder or any keen investor looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area. \r\n\r\nCall Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 98 sqm \r\n- BER E\r\n- 3 bed 2 bath \r\n- End of terrace family home \r\n- Large site to the side \r\n- Prime for further development \r\n- Great condition throughout\r\n- Entrance porch \r\n- Large hallway \r\n- Living room with fireplace \r\n- Separate living/dining room\r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Carpet stairs & landing \r\n- Leads to all rooms \r\n- Three generous bedrooms \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Main family bathroom fully tiled \r\n- Guest bathroom fully tiled \r\n- Ample built in storage \r\n- Maintenance free rear garden \r\n- Fully enclosed & private \r\n- Block built unit to the rear \r\n- Sunny south west facing orientation\r\n- Perfect for relaxing on sunny summer evenings \r\n- Built in awning \r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Double glazed windows \r\n- Top quality blinds \r\n- Off-street parking to the front \r\n- Low maintenance driveway\r\n- Located on peaceful cul de sac \r\n- Mature and exclusive development \r\n- Within minutes' drive of M50 motorway \r\n- Tallaght Village within easy reach \r\n- Local shops & schools within walking distance \r\n- Tymon park within moments' walk \r\n- First time buyers dream \r\n- Perfect for first time buyers \r\n\r\nDirections - D24 HPY0"
      },
      {
